cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "quantum-group: Exact SymPy verification of explicit U_q(sl_2) and GL_q(2|1) matrix identities"
abstract: >-
  A small SymPy package that builds the explicit matrices behind concrete
  quantum-group calculations and checks identities as exact residual
  matrices: finite-dimensional U_q(sl_2) representations, their defining
  relations and generator-level Hopf identities, tensor products and
  Clebsch-Gordan highest-weight vectors, the fundamental R-matrix with
  Yang-Baxter, braid, Hecke and coproduct-intertwining checks, and the
  graded Yang-Baxter equation for the GL_q(2|1) R-matrix of Celik and
  Celik (2021). Checks are representation-level verifications, not proofs
  in the abstract algebra.
